{
    "title": "\u30de\u30f3\u30ac\u307b\u3063\u3068",
    "description": "Manga Hot! is a manga app where you can enjoy comics for boys, girls, young adults, and women. You can enjoy works from a variety of genres, from masterpieces to the latest works delivered every day.\r\n\r\n[Characteristics of Manga Hot]\r\n\r\n\u25c6Anyone can easily read manga right away, no membership registration required.\r\n\r\n\"Manga Hot\" is an app that allows you to read manga in a wide range of genres, from classics to masterpieces.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Exclusive and advance distribution is abundant!\r\n\r\n\"Manga Hot\" has a large number of exclusive works that can only be read here, as well as advance works that will be distributed quickly. You can enjoy the works you are interested in at a great price.\r\n\r\n\u25c6Easy-to-read manga in page-turning format\r\n\r\n\"MangaHot\" provides manga display in a left/right page flip format that is optimized for smartphones. You can read smoothly anywhere, so you can enjoy an immersive manga experience.\r\n\r\n[Popular works currently being distributed! ]\r\n\r\n\u30fbValkyrie of the End (exclusive distribution of the latest episode)\r\n\u30fbMother parasite\r\n\u30fbGachi Koi Adhesive Beast ~I want to be the girlfriend of an online streamer~\r\n\u30fbBrutal: Confession of a Murderous Police Officer\r\n\u30fbUnsung Cinderella Hospital Pharmacist Midori Aoi\r\n\u30fb19th medical record Akira Tokushige's interview\r\n\u30fbWhile hanging out with Rinko-chan\r\n\u30fbAre there no gals who are kind to otakus?\r\n\u30fbUnrevealed true identity: The strongest thread user becomes a vengeful god of death\r\n\u30fbMonkey\r\n\u30fbGirlfriend through filter\r\n\u30fbReplica Ex-Wife's Revenge\r\n\u30fbMe, my husband, and my husband's boyfriend\r\n\u30fbPut mud on your face\r\n\u30fbThe curse of love can be broken with love\r\n\u30fbConditions for a professional girlfriend: Women who want to marry a celebrity\r\n\u30fbChiruran Shinsengumi Requiem\r\n\u30fbTokyo Duel Round Battle\r\n\u30fbWitch Wars\r\n\u30fbDifferent world territory reform ~Public projects starting with earth magic~\r\n\u30fbOshi became a subordinate\r\n\u30fbKeep a boy\r\n\u30fbMeshinuma.\r\n\u30fbWakako sake\r\n...and many other lineups!\r\n\r\n\r\n\u25c6We deliver a wide variety of genres!\r\n\r\nWe handle manga from a variety of genres, including romance, fantasy, action, horror, and gags. There is a wide variety of works that everyone can enjoy, and you will discover something new every day.\r\n\r\n\u25c6Safe and secure official manga app\r\n\r\n\"Manga Hot\" is an official app that distributes content with official permission from copyright holders. Unlike illegal pirated copies, we provide an environment where you can enjoy manga with peace of mind.\r\n\r\n[Official SNS]\r\nThe latest information and great deals are being distributed on Official X (Twitter) and Instagram. Don't miss out on the latest updates!\r\n\r\n\u2022 Official X: https://twitter.com/mangahot_jp\r\n\u2022 Official Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/mangahot_jp\r\n\r\n[Recommended environment]\r\nAndroid OS 6.0 or higher\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or feedback, please contact us through the in-app help.\r\n\r\nterms of service\r\nhttps://mangahot.jp/app_contract/contract.php\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy\r\nhttps://mangahot.jp/app_contract/policy.php\r\n\r\n\"Manga Hot\" is operated as a joint venture by Coremix Co., Ltd. and Imagineer Co., Ltd.\r\n\r\nWe distribute revenue to authors based on the number of views and support for their manga.\r\n\r\n(C)Coamix Inc.\r\n(C)Imagineer Co., Ltd.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Manga Hot! is a manga app where you can enjoy comics for boys, girls, young adults, and women. You can enjoy works from a variety of genres, from masterpieces to the latest works delivered every day.<br><br>[Characteristics of Manga Hot]<br><br>\u25c6Anyone can easily read manga right away, no membership registration required.<br><br>&quot;Manga Hot&quot; is an app that allows you to read manga in a wide range of genres, from classics to masterpieces.<br><br>\u25c6 Exclusive and advance distribution is abundant!<br><br>&quot;Manga Hot&quot; has a large number of exclusive works that can only be read here, as well as advance works that will be distributed quickly. You can enjoy the works you are interested in at a great price.<br><br>\u25c6Easy-to-read manga in page-turning format<br><br>&quot;MangaHot&quot; provides manga display in a left/right page flip format that is optimized for smartphones. You can read smoothly anywhere, so you can enjoy an immersive manga experience.<br><br>[Popular works currently being distributed! ]<br><br>\u30fbValkyrie of the End (exclusive distribution of the latest episode)<br>\u30fbMother parasite<br>\u30fbGachi Koi Adhesive Beast ~I want to be the girlfriend of an online streamer~<br>\u30fbBrutal: Confession of a Murderous Police Officer<br>\u30fbUnsung Cinderella Hospital Pharmacist Midori Aoi<br>\u30fb19th medical record Akira Tokushige&#39;s interview<br>\u30fbWhile hanging out with Rinko-chan<br>\u30fbAre there no gals who are kind to otakus?<br>\u30fbUnrevealed true identity: The strongest thread user becomes a vengeful god of death<br>\u30fbMonkey<br>\u30fbGirlfriend through filter<br>\u30fbReplica Ex-Wife&#39;s Revenge<br>\u30fbMe, my husband, and my husband&#39;s boyfriend<br>\u30fbPut mud on your face<br>\u30fbThe curse of love can be broken with love<br>\u30fbConditions for a professional girlfriend: Women who want to marry a celebrity<br>\u30fbChiruran Shinsengumi Requiem<br>\u30fbTokyo Duel Round Battle<br>\u30fbWitch Wars<br>\u30fbDifferent world territory reform ~Public projects starting with earth magic~<br>\u30fbOshi became a subordinate<br>\u30fbKeep a boy<br>\u30fbMeshinuma.<br>\u30fbWakako sake<br>...and many other lineups!<br><br><br>\u25c6We deliver a wide variety of genres!<br><br>We handle manga from a variety of genres, including romance, fantasy, action, horror, and gags. There is a wide variety of works that everyone can enjoy, and you will discover something new every day.<br><br>\u25c6Safe and secure official manga app<br><br>&quot;Manga Hot&quot; is an official app that distributes content with official permission from copyright holders. Unlike illegal pirated copies, we provide an environment where you can enjoy manga with peace of mind.<br><br>[Official SNS]<br>The latest information and great deals are being distributed on Official X (Twitter) and Instagram. Don&#39;t miss out on the latest updates!<br><br>\u2022 Official X: https://twitter.com/mangahot_jp<br>\u2022 Official Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/mangahot_jp<br><br>[Recommended environment]<br>Android OS 6.0 or higher<br><br>If you have any questions or feedback, please contact us through the in-app help.<br><br>terms of service<br>https://mangahot.jp/app_contract/contract.php<br><br>Privacy policy<br>https://mangahot.jp/app_contract/policy.php<br><br>&quot;Manga Hot&quot; is operated as a joint venture by Coremix Co., Ltd. and Imagineer Co., Ltd.<br><br>We distribute revenue to authors based on the number of views and support for their manga.<br><br>(C)Coamix Inc.<br>(C)Imagineer Co., Ltd.",
